error: `assert` takes 1 argument, 2 given
  `assert` writes the condition as its message
  --> error_assert_message.sg:3:5
 3 |     assert(stock >= 5, "not enough in stock")
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  hint: for a message of your own: `if !(stock >= 5) { panic("not enough in stock") }`
